4. <source>
As you can observe that  <audio>, <video>  elements contain the <source> element, the <source> tag is  used to attach multimedia files.

Syntax:

<source src="" type="">
   ...
</source>




<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        h1 {
            color: green;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <center>
        <h1>GeeksforGeeks</h1>
        <h2>Source Tag</h2>
        <audio controls>
            <source src="audio.mp3" 
                    type="audio/mp3">
        </audio>
    </center>
</body>
</html>
